Read AGENTS.md first (the router) and CLAUDE.md (engineering policy, never-list).

Akinator runs on EVERY change with no command typed (docs/RULES.md rules 17 and 18): ask,
resolve, audit, plan, implement, document, skillify, rule, contextify, memoize, index and sync,
verify. Procedure: skills/akinator/SKILL.md. Homes: context/akinator-station-map.md.

Declare the knowledge delta by path, or write "knowledge delta: none, because <reason>".
Docs, the wiki (docs/wiki/), skills, rules, context/ and memory/ land in the same commit as the
code, with the business, product and technical why, before and after, the date and the tests
actually run. Unknowns are "_Unknown - ask the owner and record the answer._".

Main is reached only through `npm run ship`. Never push by hand, never bypass a hook.

